# > Backpack Exchange & Wallet 全终端覆盖 (Web / iOS / Android)

# 1. User-Agent 规则：精准捕获 iOS/Android App 客户端流量
USER-AGENT,Backpack*,PROXY
USER-AGENT,*backpack*,PROXY

# 2. 域名后缀规则：匹配 Web 端网页、底层 API 接口及相关生态
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,backpack.exchange,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,backpack.app,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xnft.gg,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coral.community,PROXY

# 3. 关键字规则：兜底拦截，覆盖可能遗漏的静态资源 CDN 
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,backpack,PROXY
